say a Set of IDs and every ID is only

64
00:02:34,739 --> 00:02:35,445
allowed once.

65
00:02:36,326 --> 00:02:38,811
As I said, we create a Set with the new Set

66
00:02:38,811 --> 00:02:41,247
constructor here and to that constructor,

67
00:02:41,456 --> 00:02:44,101
you actually can pass an array of values and

68
00:02:44,197 --> 00:02:46,569
then these values would be your initial

69
00:02:46,602 --> 00:02:49,150
values in the set. If this array would

70
00:02:49,150 --> 00:02:51,378
