So here we can, for example, add an ID ABC,

77
00:03:08,320 --> 00:03:09,971
we can add the ID 1,

78
00:03:10,708 --> 00:03:12,295
and we could add other types of data as

79
00:03:12,407 --> 00:03:12,519
well.

80
00:03:13,144 --> 00:03:14,603
So maybe also BB2

81
00:03:15,596 --> 00:03:18,224
And then let's say we also try to add 1

82
00:03:18,480 --> 00:03:18,784
again.

